  target is retained but cannot be called verified. This does not prove an
  atomic snapshot under continuous foreign writes. Windows does not claim
  the same directory crash-durability guarantee.
  Optional `--capsule` uses the version-one builder,
  round-trips canonical ID/fingerprint and exact raw payload via its independent
